<p>I can see this becoming the foundation of a great canon, with each item having its own associated articles (scps, tales, maybe a -J). As it stands I love it, but I'm a sucker for archaeological scps in general.</p>
<p>The one thing I will nitpick is that the article states that almost everything the foundation knows about Aquarian Disco was learned on the expedition, but never expands on that statement at all. You've stated you want further articles in the series to expand on that information, which is a great idea, but I would hope to see at least a few small things in here to justify the inclusion of the aformentioned statement</p>

